WEBVTT

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:15.950
So what happened to becoming 
Well's concubines?

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.600
Oh, Operation Concubine Seduction?

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.330
Well, we're already his fellow party members.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.470
We figure there's no need to rush things.

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:27.790
Besides, our summer break is almost over.

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:35.780
So we'll resume Operation Concubine 
Seduction after we return to Breichburg.

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:37.140
Look forward to it.

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:42.180
I guess he does have Elise 
in the capital, after all.

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:48.940
Pardon the intrusion.

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:51.650
She says she's come here to see Well.

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:55.110
Oh, um... Well's been summoned 
to the castle, you see...

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:59.450
Yes... I was just hoping to talk a bit.

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:09.170
Um, would you all mind if I asked you...

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:14.530
what kind of man Baronet Baumeister is?

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:20.080
I would like you to slay a dragon.

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:21.260
Dra—

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:25.770
I humbly accept.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:28.380
<i>I'm a corporate slave.</i>

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:58.130
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

